course: dictionary
lesson: 4242
title: Family words: grandson
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A family tree shows who is related to whom. The word grandson helps you read one: it is a boy who is the son of your son or daughter. «Ashoka, Chandragupta Maurya's grandson, conquered the land of Kalinga.» Ashoka is a boy, and Chandragupta Maurya is his grandparent, so Ashoka is Chandragupta's grandson.
explain: Look at the clue words in the sentence. «His grandson Qianlong ruled about 60 years» tells you Qianlong is the son of a child of the emperor, so he is two generations below him. Ask yourself: whose son is he, and whose child is that parent?
explain: A girl in the same family position is a granddaughter, and both are grandchildren. «Emma was dared to prank-call a random number; a grandma answered, frightened it was bad news about her grandson.» The clue is the family link: the grandma was worried about a boy in her family.
fact: A grandson is the son of your son or daughter.
fact: A grandson is a type of grandchild; a girl in the same position is a granddaughter.
fact: «Grandson» is a noun, and its plural is grandsons.
fact: «Genghis's grandson Kublai Khan became emperor of China.» Here the clue words show the family link.
fact: In maths word problems about families, grandsons and granddaughters are counted as grandchildren.
exercise: «Ashoka, Chandragupta Maurya's grandson, conquered the land of Kalinga.» Who is Ashoka's grandparent? | Marco Polo | *Chandragupta Maurya | The Kangxi Emperor | Kalinga
exercise: A boy is the grandson of whom? | His cousins | His aunts | His neighbours | *His grandparents
exercise: Which word means a girl in the same family position as a grandson? | Grandpa | *Granddaughter | Grandma | Cousin
test: «Kublai Khan, Genghis's grandson, became emperor of China.» Who was Kublai Khan's grandparent? | Ashoka | Marco Polo | Qianlong | *Genghis
test: What is a grandson? | A grandparent who lives far away | A teacher at school | *A boy who is the son of your son or daughter | A girl who is your grandmother's friend
exam: A family has 3 grandsons and 2 granddaughters. How many grandchildren are there in total? | 3 | 2 | 6 | *5
